OL,3,GNEWSAGardeners reporting false autumn
OL,4,Aafter dry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardeners in south-east England are
OL,7,Freporting "signs of early onset of
OL,8,Fautumn" as trees lose their leaves and
OL,9,Fbranches in August.
OL,11,FAfter record-breaking dry spells and
OL,12,Fmultiple heatwaves, some trees have
OL,13,Fbegun shedding their leaves earlier
OL,14,Fthan expected in a so-called false
OL,15,Fautumn.
OL,17,FKristyna Kay-Clough, head gardener at
OL,18,FGreat Comp Garden in Kent, said plants
OL,19,Fwere "losing their leaves just so they
OL,20,Fdon't have to suffer any longer".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
