OL,3,GNEWSAGardeners reporting false autumn
OL,4,Aafter dry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're hoping that if we get good
OL,7,Fmoisture throughout the winter months
OL,8,Fthe plants can actually recover and
OL,9,Fstart fresh next year," she told the
OL,10,FBBC.
